          </div>
          <div class="p-6 bg-paper rounded-2xl border border-black/5 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-bold">Best Fleet</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink/50 leading-relaxed">Modern, well-maintained bikes only. No old stock.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 bg-paper rounded-2xl border border-black/5 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-bold">Unlimited Mileage</h4>
